	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Champ in the making!\rThis is the practice hall now--no\nbadge on the line, but Roxanne up\ftop battles like there is.\rHer students take the court first.\nWarm up on them!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, Champ in the making!\nI’m no Trainer, but I can give\fsome advice!\rRoxanne’s Rock types punish\ncareless Normal and Flying moves.\rStatus moves, held items, and\nsmart switching--that’s the whole\fsyllabus. Use all three!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nice battle! Keep it up, and\nAzalea’s badge is as good as\fyours!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">League Practice Hall\n(the old Violet Gym)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">League Practice Hall\rVisiting instructor: Roxanne\n(Rustboro City, Hoenn)\fPre-badge assessments daily.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: I’m Roxanne. I led a gym\nin Hoenn once; now I teach, which\fwas always the part I loved.\rThis is a practicum, not a badge\nmatch--but I’d like you to treat\fit as though everything were on\nthe line.\rThat’s how you learn what “on the\nline” even feels like.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: Two of my students first,\nthen me--though I see you’ve\falready made the rounds.\rA gym battle is not a test of\nwhether you know one answer.\rIt is a test of whether you can\nkeep THINKING after your first\fanswer fails. Let’s find out if\nyou can.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: Now me. Rock Pokémon are\nhonest teachers--they punish\fcarelessness immediately and\nforgive nothing.\rLead well. Switch when you must.\nShow me the thinking, not just the\fwinning.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: You adjusted. That\nmatters more than winning quickly--\fwinning quickly is mostly luck\nwearing a confident face.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: Rock Tomb. Damage AND\ncontrol--it slows them so your\fplan has time to work. Fitting, I\nthink.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: I came up through Hoenn\ngyms, so take this from someone\fwho’s stood on the leader’s side\nof the field: you’re ready for a\freal one.\rAzalea gives the first badge.\nGo and earn it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: You’re here early. See\nthe tower first--Earl tells me it\fhas a lesson I shouldn’t preempt.\rThen come back. I’ll be warming up\nthe students.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0558_T22GYM0101_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">ROXANNE: Azalea gives the first\nbadge. Go and earn it.\rAnd keep thinking after the first\nanswer fails--that’s the whole\fcraft.</language>
	</row>
</body>
